  "question": {
    "text": "An object and a concave mirror are approaching each other with velocities <math><mn>10 m/s</mn></math> and <math><mn>5 m/s</mn></math> as shown in figure. The velocity of image of object at the instant shown in figure is<br />\r<br />\r<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/nta_abhyas/jee_main/images/136234q.png\" style=\"max-width:100%; object-fit:contain\" style=\"width: 230px; height: 200px;\" />",
