  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "The formula for velocity of image is given by :<br /><br /><math><mo>=</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">u</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>10</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>15</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></math><br /><br /><math><mo>∴</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mrow></msub></math><br /><br />Therefore, <math><msub><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></mrow><mo>→</mo></mover></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi></mrow></msub><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></mrow><mo>^</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>10</mn><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></mrow><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></mrow><mo>^</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><br /><math><mo>⇒</mo><msub><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></mrow><mo>→</mo></mover></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>65</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></mrow><mo>^</mo></mover></math>",
